Confocal images were captured in Airyscan high-resolution mode on a LSM 880 confocal microscope system equipped with a 63× Plan Apochromat 1.4 NA objective (Carl Zeiss). For z-stack imaging, images with 0.2 μm per section were obtained. For live-cell imaging, cells were grown on live-cell chambers (Lab-Tek) and observed with a LSM 880 microscope at 37°C with 5% CO
2
