Mouse experiments
Recombinant adeno-associated virus (rAAV) packing HA-tagged ORP8 WT, ORP8 T54A/S65A, ORP8 LIRs mutant and ORP5 vectors were produced in HEK293T cells (Vigenebio). Eight weeks old
