Trizol was used to isolate total RNA from liver tissue. RNA reverse transcription was performed using a 1st strand cDNA synthesis kit. qPCR analysis was performed using HiScript II Q Select RT SuperMix on a real-time PCR machine (Bio-Rad). ORP8 qPCR primer sequence: ATGGAGGCAGCCTTAGCAGA; GAPDH qPCR primer sequence: AGGTCGGTGTGAACGGATTTG. The Comparative CT method was used to quantify each mRNA.
